<</AP<</N 502 0 R>>/BS<</S/S/Type/Border/W 0>>/Border[0 0 0]/Contents(2 2  The specific roles of each co-author in this study is provided at the end of the paper. All co-authors who were directly involved in implementation of the project that is featured as a case study were not directly involved in designing the study design, presenting the results, or drawing the conclusions. However, they did play a critical role in providing essential data on project andpolicytopics,andinvalidatingt heanalysis,results,andconclusionspresentedhere.Theirinclusionasco- authorsisconsistent with the guidelines of the institutions with which the main authors are affiliated.)/Dest(10460_2026_10976_Article.indd:Dest_Footnote_3333_28299:161)/F 4/H/N/Rect[234.818 718.262 238.318 704.8]/StructParent 90/Subtype/Link/Type/Annot>>
